ting patients with swallowing difficulties.\",13\r\n453,FLUOROSCOPIA,,2\r\n389,EUROPEAN SOCIETY FOR SWALLOWING DISORDERS,\"The European Society for Swallowing Disorders (ESSD) is an organization dedicated to advancing research and education concerning swallowing disorders, particularly dysphagia. In 2012, the ESSD played a pivotal role by hosting a meeting that initiated the International Dysphagia Diet Standardisation Initiative (IDDSI), aimed at standardizing practices related to dysphagia management. Additionally, the ESSD is committed to providing guidelines and standards for the diagnosis and treatment of swallowing disorders, ensuring that healthcare professionals have access to the most current and effective practices in the field.\",4\r\n729,INTERNATIONAL DYSPHAGIA DIET STANDARDISATION INITIATIVE,\"The International Dysphagia Diet Standardisation Initiative (IDDSI) is an organization dedicated to standardizing the terminology and descriptors associated with food textures and viscosities specifically for patients suffering from dysphagia. This initiative aims to create a unified framework for the values and nomenclature used in nutritional treatments for dysphagia on a global scale, ensuring consistency and clarity in dietary recommendations for affected individuals.\",2\r\n470,CIPLINARES,Ciplinare is an organization involved in the analysis and diagnosis of swallowing phases using instrumental tests.,3\r\n409,BASE DE LA LENGUA,The base of the tongue is an anatomical area assessed for its function in swallowing during the VED.,1\r\n411,CONSTRICTORES FARÍNGEOS,The constrictores faríngeos are muscles involved in swallowing that are activated during the assessment process.,1\r\n414,DEGLUCIONES SECAS,\"Degluciones secas refer to the dry swallows performed by the patient, which are observed during the VED to assess swallowing function.\",1\r\n445,EQUIPO DE ATENCIÓN MÉDICA,The medical care team is responsible for conducting the VFS and ensuring the safety of both t